Package: yieldcurve
Title: Basic Yield Curve Estimation Models
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-07-22
Authors@R: person("Paweł", "Kliber", email = "p.kliber@ue.poznan.pl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Paweł Kliber [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Paweł Kliber <p.kliber@ue.poznan.pl>
Description: Initial tools for yield curve estimation with Nelson-Siegel,
    Nelson-Siegel-Svensson, and Diebold-Li dynamic Nelson-Siegel models. This
    preliminary package fits models to observed yields and includes validation,
    preparation, cash-flow, dirty-price, yield-to-maturity, and price-based
    estimation helpers for bond and quote data.
